Package: dtametaTMB
Title: Diagnostic Test Accuracy Meta-Analysis using Template Model Builder
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Claus", "Nowak",
             email = "claus.nowak@donau-uni.ac.at",
             role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Fits the hierarchical summary receiver operating characteristic (HSROC)
    model of Rutter and Gatsonis (2001), the bivariate binomial-normal model of
    Reitsma et al. (2005), and the threshold-based bivariate time-to-event model of
    Hoyer et al. (2018) using Template Model Builder (TMB). Provides subgroup analyses,
    HSROC meta-regression, likelihood-ratio tests, SROC plots, confidence and prediction
    regions, and coupled forest plots.
License: GPL (>= 2)
